// A control of coderules, by learner-model's lists: a module that breaks every rule, each line
// marked with the rules it breaks. Nothing builds it, and it is kept as go.mod.control, so that it
// is no module the go command sees, nor one nested in this one: the test reads it under that name.
module example.com/coderules

go 1.27.3

require example.com/dependency v1.0.0 // want require
